# Compiled panel daemon. src/panel is where you build by hand as well as
# where the firmware build runs, so whether this file is an x86-64 host
# binary or an i586 target one depends on who ran make last. That is the
# same confusion post-build.sh cleans either side of the cross build; it
# should never be committed on top of it.
/src/panel/bdp-panel
*.o
